"entity": {
"name": "Uniphar PLC",
"description": "Uniphar Plc engages in the provision of services within the pharmaceutical and healthcare sector. It operates through the following segments: Uniphar Supply Chain & Retail, Uniphar Pharma and Uniphar Medtech. The Uniphar Supply Chain & Retail segment pre-wholesale and wholesale distribution of pharmaceutical, healthcare and animal health products to pharmacies, hospitals and veterinary clinics in Ireland. The Uniphar Pharma segment operates a global business with high-value services across the life cycle of a pharmaceutical product. The Uniphar Pharma segment operates a global business with high-value services across the life cycle of a pharmaceutical product. The company was founded in 1967 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.",
